# Global site = Word Atlas

Follow `docs/design/global-site.md`. Never apply kajakorean.com `--quiz-*`, teal, pill CTAs, or mint gradients here.

- Paper `#f4efe6`, ink `#1b1511`, tutor stamp `#c43c1a`
- Language rail colors via `data-lang` (es/fr/de/it/ar/ja)
- Radius 4–8px; hairline borders; no drop shadows; no sticky glass header
- Fonts already on the root layout: Bricolage (display) + Plus Jakarta (body). Do not add Google fonts.
- Nav uses native names (Español, Français, …). Charts are plates with captions, not SaaS cards.
